#: scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d389f3970a51a1f666df74b8ee32f6f0dc6a68c85fc1855bb83b8409a08ff9b
