msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I would eventually have to find some kind of work—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫some way to support "
"myself and Nellie—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以我得尽快成为劳动力，⟪k:1⟫养家糊口——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f99a136d7a2b98ca365a9f220c6786d935fe5237ef311b029fe5d5a5947af67
